# FILE NOTES (for future updates)
# File: .gitignore
# Purpose: Keeps installed packages and local junk out of the GitHub repo.
#   node_modules is rebuilt automatically by Render during deploy.
#   _to_delete/ is a holding pen for files Claude moves aside on Jim's
#   computer (the remote connection can create/move files but not delete
#   them) - Jim empties it whenever; Git must never track it.
# Change log:
#   2026-08-06 - Initial version.
#   2026-08-06 - Ignore _to_delete/ holding folder. (latest change)

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
.env
_to_delete/

# I did no harm and this file is not truncated
